[N 42-43 Stranglethorn Vale]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\Booty Bay: Friz's caravan errands for Caravaneer Ruzzgot (the Bloodsail Trunk, the Venture Co. ledger and the stolen shipment), Shaky Phillipe's giblets and all ten Gorilla Fangs from the Mistvale gorillas, and Nesingwary's Jungle Stalkers. Pickups for Tanaris, the Hinterlands and the Cape. Ends on the boat to Ratchet.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel 41|r  -  this chapter wants level 41: the Elder Mistvale Gorillas and the Jungle Stalkers are 40-41, the Venture Co. Agents 39, and Stoley's Debt and Tran'rek need level 40 to accept. Under 41: take the gorillas from the west edge one at a time and leave the Stalkers to last. Under 40: Stoley's Debt (2872) and Tran'rek (2864) cannot be taken yet; take them when you reach 40, before the boat (chapter 46 needs both)
[OC]|cffffffffBooty Bay|r  -  you start at Aerie Peak after chapter 44 with hearth = Stormwind, and bind Booty Bay on arrival. About 16,200 quest XP on the plain quests and 40s of quest money; every giver and hand-in comes from the DB except the Bloodsail Trunk (below)
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried in:|r I Know a Guy (95295, from Friz Frazzlespark in chapter 42) hands in here. Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail (1452) and From Port to Port (95219), and Shipping and Handling (95296) if you have it, ride on untouched
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Training:|r no shaman trainer in Booty Bay; the next stop is Ironforge in chapter 48

