[OC]|cffffffffThe Mistvale gorillas|r  -  north out of town, then east into the valley (about 11 units; the road is not in the data). Elder Mistvale Gorillas are 40-41 and normal, 28 spawns at 31-35,58-68, densest at 32-34.5,64.5-67.6. |cFFFF0000Danger:|r keep west of x 35: the Silverback Patriarchs (42-43) and Witch Doctor Unbagwa's spot (Mokk the Savage 44, Konda 43, Enraged Silverbacks 41-42 listed there) lie just east
