[OC]|cffffffffNorth Stranglethorn|r  -  ride north on the road to Nesingwary's camp (about 54 units; it passes Grom'gol, a Horde town: do not stop). You pass the Jungle Stalkers on the way; they count only after Hemet gives the quest
